{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01896","headline":"杂曲歌辞 独不见 · 戴叔伦","name":"杂曲歌辞 独不见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前宫路非远，旧苑春将遍。\n玉户看早梅，雕梁数归燕。\n身轻逐舞袖，香暖传歌扇。\n自知秋风词，长侍昭阳殿。\n谁信後庭人，年年独不见。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}